  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Gender Based Violence, Health, and WASH Response in North Darfur</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will deliver an integrated emergency response in North Darfur, prioritising enhanced support for survivors of conflict-related sexual violence and other forms of gender-based violence (GBV) while also addressing urgent health and WASH needs for displaced and conflict-affected communities.</narrative>
  </description>
